    await dispatch('revision', `Revision ${r.id} in ${pdir()}/revisions.json: redo ONLY the selected parts (its ranges and eventIds, in ms and frames at ${FPS} fps) per its instruction${r.treatment ? ` using the ${r.treatment} treatment` : ''}${atts.length ? ` with the attached sketch (${atts[0].uploadPath})` : ''}; keep everything else identical. Re-render only the affected frames where you can, re-export EDIT_MAP.json and update render.json. Set this revision's "status" to "running" while you work, then "done" or "failed" (add a "note").`);
